      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RITZA ROCKER (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (23.64) in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Worth another chance. DEMENTIA (2) jumped well and was right in the mix before fading out of it late when 6th over 400m at this track in a Grade 5. Likely to be thereabouts. LACY SARAH (3) finished third (23.55) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 7th at Gosford. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. ZUMA ZESTA (8) looks an each-way chance.",
